<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in Italian first</p>
<p>division after matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>8 - Abel Balbo (Roma)</p>
<p>7 - Filippo Inzaghi (Atalanta), George Weah (Milan)</p>
<p>6 - Pasquale Luiso (Piacenza), Marcelo Otero (Vicenza)</p>
<p>5 - Roberto Mancini (Sampdoria), Enrico Chiesa (Parma),</p>
<p>Giuseppe Signori (Lazio)</p>
<p>4 - Oliver Bierhoff and Paolo Poggi (both Udinese), Sandro</p>
<p>Tovalieri (Reggiana), Igor Kolyvanov (Bologna), Luis Oliveira</p>
<p>(Fiorentina), Alfredo Aglietti (Napoli)</p>
<p>3 - Roberto Baggio and Marco Simone (both Milan), Gabriel</p>
<p>Batistuta (Fiorentina), Nicola Caccia (Napoli), Giacomo</p>
<p>Banchelli (Cagliari), Carlo Nervo (Bologna), Massimiliano</p>
<p>Allegri and Marco Negri (both Perugia), Michele Padovano</p>
<p>(Juventus), Adolfo Valencia (Reggiana), Javier Zanetti (Inter)</p>
